The components in this folder are shadcn/ui (https://ui.shadcn.com), from
https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui apps/v4/registry/new-york-v4/ui at c257f688cf4de7ec10cc1be84cad29cd4631182c
(the commit orchestrator/app/ui is on). 2026-11-20 changes, each marked in the source:
- progress.tsx and separator.tsx: bb shares no Radix Progress or Separator runtime with plugins and usage-meter
  bundles none, so the Radix Root and Indicator are plain divs carrying the attributes Radix sets (role, aria-*,
  data-state, data-orientation). The classes are upstream's. Progress takes an indicatorClassName for the tone colour.
- badge.tsx: no asChild (that needs Radix Slot); `dark:` is written `[&:is(.dark_*)]:` (bb's .dark class).
- utils.ts: cn() as upstream, plus the plugin marks a node outside the plugin root needs for its Tailwind.

